<title>THAILAND: BOXING-SAMAN RETAINS WBC LIGHT-FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-SAMAN RETAINS WBC LIGHT-FLYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Saman Sor Jaturong retained his World Boxing Council (WBC) light-flyweight crown on Saturday with a fourth-round knock-out of South African challenger Mzukizi Marali in the northern city of Petchabun.</p>
</text>
